data: {"name":"get_session_insights","label":"Analysing the session…"}

event: text
data: {"delta":"**Where the time is.** Your best lap sits close to your theoretical best, "}

event: text
data: {"delta":"so the pace is there — the gap is in stringing your best sectors together.\n\n"}

event: text
data: {"delta":"- **Brake release into the slow corners**: the minimum speed at the apex is where the laps differ most.\n"}

event: text
data: {"delta":"- **Throttle pickup**: full throttle comes later on your slower laps onto the longest straight.\n\n"}

event: text
data: {"delta":"For the next session, pick one corner and work on releasing the brake a little earlier. "}

event: text
data: {"delta":"Your instructor can tell you whether the car is ready for it."}

